            "review_title": "Review at Caay Delicious",
            "review_text": "Sarah L\nSydney, Australia92 contributions\n1\nStunning gluten free food in HCMC\nDec 2019 • Friends\nI had a stunning meal here one night in HCMC. The chef catered to all my gluten free needs which is always so tricky when dining in some parts of Asia. The food was excellent - Asian Fusion. The restaurant is elegant but comfortable - there is an outdoor section if you’d prefer to sit in comfort and watch the busy world go by. Otherwise the inside air conditioner is most welcome. Great venue for small gatherings, an intimate night out, or a catch up with friends for dinner. ♥️\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
