            "review_title": "Review at Caay Delicious",
            "review_text": "Adrian Ng\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nBest Thai food in the city for sure!\nNov 2019 • Friends\nI've been here at least 5 times the past month just to try out all dishes in the menu with different friends and love it every time. So did my friends!\n\nToday at lunch we had the biggest tray ever. Including 10 different favorite dishes, including chicken wings, chicken satay, somtum, corn salads and many more. It was so big three of us had to try to finish it. The deser was so yum too. We were out of there feeling so satisfied.\n\nIts located in the heart of the city and on a cool day like today sitting outside watching people walk by on was awesome. Definitely coming back this weekend.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 18, 2019",
